        /**
         * Adds a new column to the current table.
         *
         * @param [oCell] The cell before or after which a new column will be added. If not specified, a new column will be added at the end of the table.
         * @param [isBefore=false] Adds a new column before (true) or after (false) the specified cell. If no cell is specified, then this parameter will be ignored.
         * @returns boolean
         * @see https://api.onlyoffice.com/docs/office-api/usage-api/document-api/ApiTable/Methods/AddColumn/
         */
