        /**
         * Adds the new columns to the current table.
         *
         * @param [oCell] The cell after which the new columns will be added. If not specified, the new columns will be added at the end of the table.
         * @param [nCount] Count of columns to be added.
         * @param [isBefore=false] Adds the new columns before (true) or after (false) the specified cell.
         * @returns [ApiTable](https://api.onlyoffice.com/docs/office-api/usage-api/pdf-api/ApiTable/ApiTable/)
         * @see https://api.onlyoffice.com/docs/office-api/usage-api/pdf-api/ApiTable/Methods/AddColumns/
         */
